1
00:00:00,266 --> 00:00:01,833
I just saw those things

2
00:00:01,966 --> 00:00:02,666
and suddenly remembered

3
00:00:02,666 --> 00:00:04,233
I think I saw you when we were kids too

4
00:00:04,266 --> 00:00:05,066
You think

5
00:00:05,566 --> 00:00:07,033
Earlier you were certain

6
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:09,100
Sis if you had told me earlier

7
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,300
how could I have misunderstood

8
00:00:10,433 --> 00:00:11,233
If I had told you earlier

9
00:00:11,233 --> 00:00:12,900
would you not have taken my stuff

10
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,866
The problem isn't whether I told you

11
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,800
The problem is that when you got

12
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,300
the old things that weren't yours

13
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,000
your first reaction wasn't to return them

14
00:00:20,633 --> 00:00:22,200
but to cover up the signature

15
00:00:22,666 --> 00:00:24,200
and claim the story was yours

16
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:26,266
I was just too scared

17
00:00:26,766 --> 00:00:27,566
Scared of what

18
00:00:29,033 --> 00:00:31,033
Miss Su please write

19
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,633
I'm sorry sis

20
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,233
I just wanted to help

21
00:00:39,766 --> 00:00:40,766
Before you help

22
00:00:41,033 --> 00:00:42,866
return other people's things first

23
00:00:43,166 --> 00:00:45,600
Chairman we got the original items

24
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,800
The companion signature on the receipt is Su Mingyao

25
00:00:48,066 --> 00:00:49,233
The backup predates the wedding

26
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,600
Su Yurou admitted the items

27
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,200
came from Su Mingyao's box of old things

28
00:00:53,566 --> 00:00:54,800
Verify them according to procedure

29
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:55,800
Understood

30
00:00:55,833 --> 00:00:57,033
Is Fu Chenzhou present

31
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:57,666
Yes

32
00:00:57,666 --> 00:00:59,366
The Chairman wants a word with you
